hes they encountered each other", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["player-referee dyad"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 42, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[51, 51]], "assertion": "the dataset contains 146,028 total dyads", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["dyads"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 43, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[52, 52]], "assertion": "the analysis sample includes 115,603 dyads (79.2%)", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["analysis sample"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 44, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[53, 53]], "assertion": "there are 1,419 unique players", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["players"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 45, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[54, 54]], "assertion": "there are 2,904 unique referees", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["referees"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 46, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[55, 55]], "assertion": "1,455 dyads (1.26%) had at least one red card", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["red card incidents"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 47, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[56, 56]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 48, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[57, 57]], "note": "Exposure Variable Definition subheading"}, {"id": 49, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[58, 63]], "assertion": "skin tone was rated by two independent raters on a 5-point scale (0.00 very light to 1.00 very dark) based on player profile photos", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone rating", "raters"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 50, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[64, 64]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 51, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[65, 65]], "assertion": "inter-rater reliability was excellent (Pearson r=0.923)", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["inter-rater reliability"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 52, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[66, 66]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 53, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[67, 67]], "assertion": "the primary exposure was defined as the average of the two raters' scores, dichotomized at 0.5 into light (<0.5) and dark (≥0.5) skin tone", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone exposure"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 54, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[68, 68]], "assertion": "97,425 dyads (84.3%) are classified as light skin (<0.5)", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["light skin group"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 55, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[69, 69]], "assertion": "18,178 dyads (15.7%) are classified as dark skin (≥0.5)", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["dark skin group"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 56, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[70, 70]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 57, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[71, 71]], "note": "Outcome Variable subheading"}, {"id": 58, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[72, 72]], "assertion": "the outcome was defined as a binary indicator of whether any red card was received in the player-referee dyad", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["outcome variable"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 59, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[73, 73]], "assertion": "multiple games could occur within a single dyad", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["games per dyad"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 60, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[74, 74]], "assertion": "the median games per dyad is 1, the mean is 3.0, and the range is 1-47", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["games per dyad"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 61, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[75, 75]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 62, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[76, 76]], "note": "Covariates Adjusted For subheading"}, {"id": 63, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[77, 77]], "assertion": "the model adjusted for player position (Defender, Forward, Goalkeeper, Midfielder)", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["position"], "confidence": "high"}, {"id": 64, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[78, 78]], "assertion": "defenders had the highest red card rate (1.63%) and forwards the lowest (1.02